{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EXO","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"出埃及记","commonName":"出埃及记","title":"出埃及记","order":2,"numberOfChapters":40,"sha256":"11de8085569de444dbe200dc394663ee2ea45136751a33792f363f2b98b55e6f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EXO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":40,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EXO/40.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1208},"chapter":{"number":37,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["约柜"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["比撒列用皂荚木造了一个柜，长一米一，宽七十厘米，高七十厘米。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["这柜子里外都包上纯金，还镶了一圈金边。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他造了四个金环，安在柜的四个脚上，每边两个环，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["又用皂荚木造了两根横杠，包上金，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["然后把横杠穿过柜两边的金环，便于抬柜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他用纯金造了一个施恩座，长一米一，宽七十厘米。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["又用金子在施恩座的两端打造两个基路伯天使。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["这两个基路伯天使跟施恩座连在一起，在施恩座的两端，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["面对面朝向施恩座，向上展开翅膀遮盖施恩座。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["桌子"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["他用皂荚木造了一张桌子，长九十厘米，宽四十五厘米，高七十厘米。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["整张桌子都包上纯金，四周镶上金边。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["在桌子四周造一个八厘米宽的外框，外框镶上金边。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["他又造四个金环，安在桌子四角的桌腿上，"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["金环靠近外框，以便穿横杠抬桌子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["他用皂荚木造两根横杠，外面包金，用来抬桌子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["又用纯金造桌子上的器具，就是盘、碟及献酒用的杯和瓶。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["他用纯金造了一座灯台，灯台的灯座、灯柱、油杯、花瓣和花萼都是用一块纯金打成的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["灯台两边各伸出三个分枝，共六个分枝。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["每个分枝上都有三个杏花形状、有花瓣和花萼的杯，六个分枝都是这样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["灯台上有四个杏花形状、有花瓣和花萼的杯。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["灯台上每一对分枝的相连处有花萼，三对分枝都是这样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["整座灯台，包括花萼和分枝，都是用一块纯金打成的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["他又用纯金为这座灯台造了七个灯盏，以及灯剪和灯花盘。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["造整座灯台和灯台的器具共用了六百八十两纯金。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["造香坛"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["他又用皂荚木造了一座方形的香坛，长宽各四十五厘米，高九十厘米，坛上面凸起的四角与坛连成一体，"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["坛顶、坛的四面和坛上凸起的角包上纯金，四周镶上金边。"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["他造了两个金环，安在坛两侧的金边下面，"]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":["又用皂荚木造横杠，包上金，穿在两个环里，用来抬香坛。"]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":["他又用调制香料的方法制作圣膏油和纯净芬芳的香。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EXO/37.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EXO/38.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EXO/36.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":29}